{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0444_1000_p", "source_sha256": "ddf76034794e1b0ff2fe314e6b59b266cda1865c826cc55b6d646f44202a57c6", "ja": "（今日は亜利沙たちが出演する映画の撮影。\n亜利沙は王子として、頑張っている）", "zh": "（今天是亚利沙她们出演的电影开拍。亚利沙正在努力饰演王子。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0444_1001_028ari", "source_sha256": "977d22029eece3caf5bb142da49bef36167f03d169dcbe4b1a97d260a926cf90", "ja": "サーフィアはこの庭園がお気に入りだったな……。\nよくふたりで、散歩をしたものだ。", "zh": "萨菲娅很喜欢这座庭园啊……  \n我们两个人以前经常一起散步。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0444_1002_028ari", "source_sha256": "8098290e62bb7b7f1b1b44a72476496e715ae3ec2d9761d506e6b67648c8ee4a", "ja": "僕は……なぜ、今になって彼女のことを？\n彼女を突き放したのは、僕自身だというのに……", "zh": "我……为什么偏偏在这时候想起她？\n明明是我亲手将她推开的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0444_1003_028ari", "source_sha256": "9d246dcdcc123f8d839375487973b4c34e3841d2af36162a7382ba5090ab668b", "ja": "ふぅ……。", "zh": "呼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0444_1004_p", "source_sha256": "708dc814b9c87915072b54d9793019d9bab78c016fdd27b2ae57911b366680ab", "ja": "撮影お疲れ様、亜利沙。随分、深いため息を\n吐いてたけど……流石に疲れたか？", "zh": "拍摄辛苦了，亚利沙。你刚才叹了好长一口气……果然还是累了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0444_1005_028ari", "source_sha256": "4eebe066d6b4f4b3cbc1135759712fc33c4866bf23e0873467cbae836efb825f", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん。大丈夫ですよ！\nみんなの演技を見ていれば、疲れも吹き飛びますから！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生。没事哦！\n只要看着大家的演技，疲劳就会一扫而空！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0444_1006_028ari", "source_sha256": "4e9ef98ce7ea188a318b85f53fa56b7202dd78b31bdad95b4361669184c0a22f", "ja": "アイドルちゃんたちの、様々な表情が見られて……\nありさ、この撮影に参加できて幸せです！　ムフフ♪", "zh": "能看到偶像们各种各样的表情……\n有机会参加这次拍摄，亚利沙感到好幸福！嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0444_1007_p", "source_sha256": "c1289c07bef2df7c2c205411162ccd23009f97fe80f959a3790dbde0a899fe2f", "ja": "はは、そうか。なら心配いらなかったかな？\n撮影が終わった後、ずっと静かだったから気になって。", "zh": "哈哈，这样啊。那看来是我多虑了？\n拍摄结束后一直都很安静，让我有些在意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0444_1008_028ari", "source_sha256": "ff39cee3b8c3e0be4513d06aa64612ba0f6f5f8df6b33c2048e11026b7d518e2", "ja": "あ、それはですね……。シトリムを演じるように\nなってから、ずっと考えていたことがありまして。", "zh": "啊，那是因为……自从开始饰演希特利姆之后，我一直在思考一件事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0444_1009_028ari", "source_sha256": "8908f8cb250f3e45fa024cc8d78665917f88095899a4dd026c210ea9366e1cce", "ja": "{$P$}さんは、シトリム王子が\n幸せな未来を迎えられると思いますか！？", "zh": "{$P$}先生觉得，席特利姆王子\n能迎来幸福的未来吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0444_1010_p", "source_sha256": "01772bb70cb822fdda2bfd3c9144e7955cb8a67efaf0ffa33ba1d17de8603a32", "ja": "未来……っていうのは、\nこの物語が終わった先の事かな？", "zh": "未来……是指这个故事结束之后的事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0444_1011_028ari", "source_sha256": "a3d14fb5f4b0723df5b8c7f0b673a5063269ccbad4c0c30120cc5c2aed20a995", "ja": "はい。結局、婚約は破棄されたままなので……\nシトリムはそのあと、どうなるのか気になって。", "zh": "是的。毕竟婚约还是就这样解除着……所以我有点在意，希特里姆之后会怎么样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0444_1012_p", "source_sha256": "506875ce7b061f4f8be09b3662b5b409f4f2d7325d410cac87d2b3e09fd51101", "ja": "そうだな……事情があったとはいえ、一度は\nサーフィアを酷く傷つけてしまっているし……。", "zh": "是啊……虽说事出有因，但毕竟曾经让萨菲娅受到过很深的伤害……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0444_1013_p", "source_sha256": "e24a2674c3677e1cf351bf1d90b5d3f283a47d0c232e6667866cbfe1b337c1a4", "ja": "亜利沙は、シトリムはどうなると思ってるんだ？\nいや、どうなって欲しいと思ってる、かな？", "zh": "你觉得亚利莎认为希特里姆会怎么样？\n不，应该说，你希望她变成什么样呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0444_1014_028ari", "source_sha256": "07ec5d78fdc60e2f5695b9949917e240f7e8dda342a0c1e85c1e2b001266bb21", "ja": "ありさは……シトリムにも、ちゃんと幸せに\nなって欲しいなって思います！", "zh": "亚利沙……希望希特利姆也能\n好好获得幸福！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0444_1015_028ari", "source_sha256": "30a2e27ff098aa6460dff44cdd9e62442db9a4ca1aa9ef6fc068ef75a629999f", "ja": "もちろん、シトリムにも悪いところはあります！\n一国の王子が、簡単に騙されちゃうところとか……。", "zh": "当然，希特林也是有缺点的！\n比如身为一国王子，却轻易就被人骗了之类的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0444_1016_028ari", "source_sha256": "4e89ff15dfbeb0ca730a47c65ec5798470a2c85bdefa72043beb74d49096f9e3", "ja": "でも、それも優しすぎるからだと思いますし……\nきっとまた、幸せを見つけられるって信じてます！", "zh": "不过，我觉得那也是因为他太过温柔了……\n\n我相信，他一定还能再次找到幸福！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0444_1017_p", "source_sha256": "457ebe2dfa033e43a70fe8c3130931f8caa8c5da589731066b46a13a69aaecc7", "ja": "うん。亜利沙がそう思うのなら、きっとシトリムは、\n幸せな未来を迎えられるんじゃないか？", "zh": "嗯。既然亚利沙这么认为，那席特利姆一定能\n迎来幸福的未来吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0444_1018_p", "source_sha256": "f581f02faebe69f0f1376cb24f4fe3e7fe93dc1ccc4df13e0b91aae157f2353f", "ja": "シトリムを演じてきた、亜利沙が言うんだからな！", "zh": "因为这是饰演过希特利姆的亚利沙说的啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0444_1019_028ari", "source_sha256": "bcae90d089f0b4e8425d760f0e8a61e80b180e9336546d96576e8979293233cb", "ja": "はいっ、そう思います！　ありさ、いつかシトリムに\n新しい大切なものを見つけて欲しいなって思ってます！", "zh": "是的，我也是这么想的！我希望阿利沙有一天能为希特利姆找到新的珍贵之物！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0444_1020_028ari", "source_sha256": "3dd2dc525a718945fbcdd526df5162cb3c1a05faa1e32c1a5122ef0219fa6d63", "ja": "サーフィアと同じくらい、大切に思えるもの……\nありさにとってのアイドルちゃんという存在みたいな！", "zh": "和萨菲娅一样，能够珍视的东西……  \n就像偶像对有里纱来说这样的存在！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
